---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
const title = "Guides - Toolkit Lab";
const description = "Practical guides on image compression, word counts, JSON, Base64, text case, passwords and BMI.";
---
<Base title={title} description={description} path="/guides.html">
<div class="wrap">
      <h1>Guides</h1>
      <p class="lead">Short, practical explanations of the topics behind our tools.</p>

      <div class="grid">
        <a class="card" href="guides/how-to-compress-images-for-the-web.html">
          <h3>How to Compress Images for the Web</h3>
          <p>Pick the right format, quality and size to keep images small and sharp.</p>
        </a>
        <a class="card" href="guides/how-to-count-words-and-reading-time.html">
          <h3>How to Count Words and Estimate Reading Time</h3>
          <p>What counts as a word, and how reading time is calculated.</p>
        </a>
        <a class="card" href="guides/how-to-format-and-validate-json.html">
          <h3>How to Format and Validate JSON</h3>
          <p>The strict rules of JSON, common errors and how to fix them.</p>
        </a>
        <a class="card" href="guides/what-is-base64-and-when-to-use-it.html">
          <h3>What Is Base64 and When Should You Use It?</h3>
          <p>How Base64 encoding works, where it appears and its size trade-off.</p>
        </a>
        <a class="card" href="guides/text-case-styles-explained.html">
          <h3>Text Case Styles Explained</h3>
          <p>Title Case, Sentence case, camelCase, snake_case and when to use each.</p>
        </a>
        <a class="card" href="guides/how-to-create-a-strong-password.html">
          <h3>How to Create a Strong Password</h3>
          <p>Why length matters, why uniqueness matters and how to generate one safely.</p>
        </a>
        <a class="card" href="guides/understanding-bmi-and-its-limits.html">
          <h3>Understanding BMI and Its Limits</h3>
          <p>How Body Mass Index is calculated, its categories and what it cannot show.</p>
        </a>
        <a class="card" href="guides/how-to-convert-psd-files-to-png-or-jpg.html">
          <h3>How to Convert PSD Files to PNG or JPG</h3>
          <p>Choosing between PNG and JPG, and why some PSD files will not convert.</p>
        </a>
        <a class="card" href="guides/metric-and-imperial-conversions-explained.html">
          <h3>Metric and Imperial Conversions Explained</h3>
          <p>Exact factors for length, weight and temperature, with examples.</p>
        </a>
        <a class="card" href="guides/hex-rgb-and-hsl-color-codes-explained.html">
          <h3>HEX, RGB and HSL Color Codes Explained</h3>
          <p>What each colour format means and when to use it.</p>
        </a>
        <a class="card" href="guides/how-to-count-days-between-two-dates.html">
          <h3>How to Count Days Between Two Dates</h3>
          <p>Subtraction, leap years and counting rules that avoid mistakes.</p>
        </a>
        <a class="card" href="guides/how-to-calculate-percentages.html">
          <h3>How to Calculate Percentages</h3>
          <p>The three common percentage cases, with worked examples.</p>
        </a>
        <a class="card" href="guides/how-qr-codes-work.html">
          <h3>How QR Codes Work and How to Make a Good One</h3>
          <p>Error correction levels, print size and how to test a code.</p>
        </a>
        <a class="card" href="guides/how-to-verify-a-file-with-a-hash.html">
          <h3>How to Verify a Download with a Hash</h3>
          <p>Check a file against a SHA-256 checksum, and why SHA-1 is not enough.</p>
        </a>
        <a class="card" href="guides/how-a-loan-emi-is-calculated.html">
          <h3>How a Loan EMI Is Calculated</h3>
          <p>The EMI formula, why early payments are mostly interest, and how the term matters.</p>
        </a>
        <a class="card" href="guides/what-is-lorem-ipsum.html">
          <h3>What Is Lorem Ipsum?</h3>
          <p>Where placeholder text comes from and how to use it in layouts.</p>
        </a>
        <a class="card" href="guides/how-to-time-tasks-with-a-stopwatch.html">
          <h3>How to Time Tasks with a Stopwatch</h3>
          <p>Lap timing, practice tracking and the Pomodoro method.</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

</Base>
